@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
actor "Utilizador" as U
participant "App Expo\n(Sprint 2)" as App
participant "aircraft_track()" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

U -> App : seleciona avião
App -> API : GET /aircraft/{hex}/track?minutes=60
activate API
API -> API : valida hex e 1 <= minutes <= 1440
API -> DB : TRACK: SELECT ... FROM position\nWHERE hex = ? AND ts > now() - 60 min\nORDER BY ts
note right of DB : índice (hex, ts DESC)
DB --> API : posições
API --> App : 200 [ {ts, lat, lon, altitude_ft, ...} ]
deactivate API
App -> U : desenha linha (cor por altitude)
@enduml
